WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:31.041
In the previous verse,

2
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:32.250
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.958
discussed the balance of food and sleep.

4
00:00:35.958 --> 00:00:38.750
Now here he is explaining

5
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.541
to everyone who practices yoga

6
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:44.000
the importance of balance in all aspects of life.

7
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.333
Lord Krishna says in this verse

8
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:54.500
that the person who keeps their food, recreation,

9
00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:57.500
efforts, and sleep regulated,

10
00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.666
all their material

11
00:00:58.666 --> 00:01:02.458
sufferings are removed 
through the practice of yoga.

12
00:01:02.458 --> 00:01:03.291
Lord Krishna

13
00:01:03.291 --> 00:01:04.416
is shedding light

14
00:01:04.416 --> 00:01:06.666
here on a regulated lifestyle.

15
00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:10.166
His message is clear: 
whether it's eating and drinking,

16
00:01:10.166 --> 00:01:13.333
sleeping, work, or recreation –

17
00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:16.000
if we do any of these

18
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.875
too much or too little,

19
00:01:17.875 --> 00:01:23.875
such imbalance affects both
physical and mental health.

20
00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:27.125
This makes it difficult for a yogi

21
00:01:27.125 --> 00:01:29.375
to attain a healthy, stable body

22
00:01:29.375 --> 00:01:30.750
and stable mind,

23
00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:34.666
which are essential for spiritual progress.

24
00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.666
Work is a very important part of life,

25
00:01:37.666 --> 00:01:40.375
but if we just keep working,

26
00:01:40.375 --> 00:01:43.583
both body and mind will tire.

27
00:01:43.583 --> 00:01:45.000
Along with work,

28
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:46.666
a few moments of rest,

29
00:01:46.666 --> 00:01:48.333
or light entertainment,

30
00:01:48.333 --> 00:01:51.375
or walking for some time,

31
00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:54.500
refreshes the mind and brain,

32
00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:57.208
and concentration in work increases.

33
00:01:57.208 --> 00:02:00.833
But on the other hand, 
if there's only rest and rest,

34
00:02:00.833 --> 00:02:05.500
both body and brain will
 become lazy and sluggish.

35
00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:06.541
If excessive time

36
00:02:06.541 --> 00:02:08.000
is given to entertainment,

37
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.958
some important work may be missed,

38
00:02:10.958 --> 00:02:14.125
and then later the mind 
won't focus on work either.

39
00:02:14.125 --> 00:02:15.125
Through a regulated life,

40
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:16.083
a yogi

41
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:19.208
keeps their body healthy and fit,

42
00:02:19.208 --> 00:02:20.750
keeps their mind stable,

43
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:25.333
so that both become supportive 
of their spiritual progress,

44
00:02:25.333 --> 00:02:26.708
not obstructive.

45
00:02:31.583 --> 00:02:34.083
A person sometimes,

46
00:02:34.083 --> 00:02:36.958
forgetting the path of balance,

47
00:02:36.958 --> 00:02:40.666
on one hand overdoes certain things,

48
00:02:40.666 --> 00:02:43.500
and on the other hand

49
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.375
completely ignores some things.

50
00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:48.250
For example,

51
00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.083
some people live life

52
00:02:50.083 --> 00:02:53.333
as if the only purpose is eating and drinking.

53
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:56.291
Once they like the taste of something,

54
00:02:56.291 --> 00:03:00.625
control simply breaks down.

55
00:03:00.625 --> 00:03:03.750
In today's age, for entertainment too,

56
00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:06.083
some people do the same.

57
00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:09.958
If they sit down to watch 
a program, then for hours,

58
00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:14.166
and many times they spend the entire night.

59
00:03:14.166 --> 00:03:18.208
Conversely, some people 
consider getting less sleep

60
00:03:18.208 --> 00:03:20.500
an achievement.

61
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.666
They look very happy about the fact

62
00:03:22.666 --> 00:03:24.416
that they can work for many

63
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:28.791
days without getting tired.

64
00:03:28.791 --> 00:03:30.958
Neither too little, nor too much.

65
00:03:30.958 --> 00:03:35.416
There is an adequate amount for everything.

66
00:03:35.416 --> 00:03:37.083
Whether it's work,

67
00:03:37.083 --> 00:03:40.458
or sleep, whether it's food or

68
00:03:40.458 --> 00:03:42.541
entertainment.

69
00:03:42.541 --> 00:03:45.916
If the right balance is ignored,

70
00:03:45.916 --> 00:03:49.375
it will have a bad effect on the body too,

71
00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:52.375
and on the mind too.

72
00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:55.625
My only request is

73
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:58.833
that you regulate your habits.

74
00:03:58.833 --> 00:04:01.541
Eat delicious food too,

75
00:04:01.541 --> 00:04:04.291
but ensure that nutrition

76
00:04:04.291 --> 00:04:06.083
is not ignored.

77
00:04:06.083 --> 00:04:09.625
Also, the quantity of food shouldn't be so much

78
00:04:09.625 --> 00:04:12.333
that the body itself becomes sluggish.

79
00:04:12.333 --> 00:04:17.916
Work too, but also take out some
 time for positive entertainment,

80
00:04:17.916 --> 00:04:20.583
so that the mind stays active.

81
00:04:20.583 --> 00:04:22.791
A designated amount of sleep is also

82
00:04:22.791 --> 00:04:27.291
important for the alertness of body and mind.

83
00:04:27.291 --> 00:04:30.583
The better the regulation and balance

84
00:04:30.583 --> 00:04:37.250
in every aspect of life, the happier life will be.

85
00:04:42.083 --> 00:04:43.708
Whether it's entertainment

86
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:47.250
or work, whether it's food or sleep,

87
00:04:47.250 --> 00:04:51.500
balancing all these has a significance.

88
00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.000
Neither an excess of any of these is good,

89
00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.875
nor should the quantity be so small

90
00:04:57.875 --> 00:05:00.208
that it has a negative effect.

91
00:05:00.208 --> 00:05:03.250
It is important to pay attention
 to this not only personally,

92
00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:07.500
but also as a family.

93
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:11.375
For example, it is essential for parents that

94
00:05:11.375 --> 00:05:13.541
they set the right example

95
00:05:13.541 --> 00:05:16.208
for all these things,

96
00:05:16.208 --> 00:05:17.250
because

97
00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:20.541
children will emulate their parents.

98
00:05:20.541 --> 00:05:26.166
If the parents themselves stay awake
 all night watching entertaining programs,

99
00:05:26.166 --> 00:05:30.583
then the children will learn the same thing.

100
00:05:30.583 --> 00:05:31.875
Also,

101
00:05:31.875 --> 00:05:37.208
if the whole family does 
these daily activities together,

102
00:05:37.208 --> 00:05:39.958
it will increase mutual love.

103
00:05:39.958 --> 00:05:42.583
For example, make it a rule

104
00:05:42.583 --> 00:05:45.291
that the whole family eats together.

105
00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:47.666
This will not only increase mutual harmony,

106
00:05:47.666 --> 00:05:51.250
but it will also ensure that no one

107
00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:53.083
in the house is ignoring

108
00:05:53.083 --> 00:05:56.833
an important thing like food.

109
00:05:56.833 --> 00:06:01.541
The habit of eating anything at 
odd times will also be controlled.

110
00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:05.291
The family should also 
enjoy entertainment together.

111
00:06:05.291 --> 00:06:11.708
Happy moments spent 
together keep family members united.

112
00:06:11.708 --> 00:06:12.875
Work is also

113
00:06:12.875 --> 00:06:16.541
an important part of everyone's life,

114
00:06:16.541 --> 00:06:20.583
but it's also a source of stress.

115
00:06:20.583 --> 00:06:23.083
If the family eats together,

116
00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:25.916
spends time together for entertainment,

117
00:06:25.916 --> 00:06:29.833
then work-related stress will also decrease.

118
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:31.166
And also,

119
00:06:31.166 --> 00:06:32.708
if there is any problem

120
00:06:32.708 --> 00:06:35.500
in someone's professional life,

121
00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:40.416
the family will be able to 
solve it by discussing it together.

122
00:06:40.416 --> 00:06:44.291
In some families, everyone lives under one roof,

123
00:06:44.291 --> 00:06:49.333
but they never spend time together.

124
00:06:49.333 --> 00:06:53.291
How sad is this fact.

125
00:06:53.291 --> 00:06:57.458
Don't let this happen in your family.

126
00:06:57.458 --> 00:06:59.750
Spending time with family

127
00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.958
is extremely important.

128
00:07:03.958 --> 00:07:06.833
Time spent together for food or entertainment

129
00:07:06.833 --> 00:07:11.125
strengthens family bonds.

130
00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:18.500
In professional life, many times

131
00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:21.333
a person becomes so busy

132
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:25.416
that they start ignoring a balanced life.

133
00:07:25.416 --> 00:07:28.208
There can be many reasons for this:

134
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:30.833
work pressure, high goals,

135
00:07:30.833 --> 00:07:33.458
personal expectations, etc.

136
00:07:33.458 --> 00:07:36.916
But if due to busyness,

137
00:07:36.916 --> 00:07:38.666
you start forgetting life's fundamental

138
00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:41.708
necessities,

139
00:07:41.708 --> 00:07:45.708
ultimately its adverse 
effects will definitely happen –

140
00:07:45.708 --> 00:07:49.458
on the body, on mental state,

141
00:07:49.458 --> 00:07:53.875
and consequently on professional progress too.

142
00:07:53.875 --> 00:07:56.750
Regular meals, proper rest,

143
00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.583
some entertainment to keep the mind

144
00:07:58.583 --> 00:08:00.833
cheerful, etc.

145
00:08:00.833 --> 00:08:03.125
All these are primary necessities of

146
00:08:03.125 --> 00:08:05.583
a healthy life,

147
00:08:05.583 --> 00:08:08.500
not options to be forgotten.

148
00:08:08.500 --> 00:08:12.750
Food should be sufficient, nutritious, balanced.

149
00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:16.916
If eating excessive food itself becomes a lifestyle,

150
00:08:16.916 --> 00:08:19.833
then not only will the body 
remain sluggish, but going

151
00:08:19.833 --> 00:08:24.125
forward, the body will also
 become a home for diseases.

152
00:08:24.125 --> 00:08:27.291
If rest is not taken, there will be fatigue.

153
00:08:27.291 --> 00:08:30.541
The body also has a capacity to work.

154
00:08:30.541 --> 00:08:33.208
If you work more than that capacity,

155
00:08:33.208 --> 00:08:36.541
then not only physical health, but

156
00:08:36.541 --> 00:08:40.625
the possibility of mental health 
deteriorating will also increase.

157
00:08:40.625 --> 00:08:41.833
And yes,

158
00:08:41.833 --> 00:08:45.750
in today's age where there
 is so much competition,

159
00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:50.500
maintaining mental health 
is extremely important.

160
00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.125
Therefore, take out time for entertainment too.

161
00:08:54.125 --> 00:08:56.750
This keeps the mind healthy.

162
00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:58.791
If physical and mental

163
00:08:58.791 --> 00:09:01.291
health remain excellent,

164
00:09:01.291 --> 00:09:04.083
the positive effect of all these

165
00:09:04.083 --> 00:09:07.666
will definitely be on your professional progress.

166
00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:08.958
But if

167
00:09:08.958 --> 00:09:11.916
any of these is neglected,

168
00:09:11.916 --> 00:09:13.958
today or tomorrow,

169
00:09:13.958 --> 00:09:16.875
you will have to bear its adverse effects.

170
00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:20.541
Remember, you do work

171
00:09:20.541 --> 00:09:23.333
so that you can live life well.

172
00:09:23.333 --> 00:09:25.916
What's the point of such work

173
00:09:25.916 --> 00:09:28.500
that instead of making life easier,

174
00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.541
damages health itself?

175
00:09:31.541 --> 00:09:37.125
Don't ignore balanced and healthy life.
